.TH DRAW3DDEMO 1
.SH NAME
draw3ddemo \- showcase for math/draw3d
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wm/draw3ddemo
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Draw3ddemo
is a
.IR wm (1)
application that exercises
.IR draw3d (2).
It draws a rotating mesh under perspective projection, a billboard image, and a
simple overlay.
The scene animates until the window is closed.
.PP
The keys are:
.TF q
.TP
.B q, Esc
quit
.PD
.PP
It appears on the Wm Misc menu as
.BR Draw3d .
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/wm/draw3ddemo.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR wm (1)
